readTranscriptFeatures are now part of another package "genomation". If you install the latest version of that it might resolve the error. The error indicates that coordinates are wrong, probably after exon/intron coordinate extraction some end coordinates < start coordinates. This could happen if you prepared the bed file yourself or converted from GFF.

If you still get the same error after updating genomation, please send a reproducible example

Best,
Altuna

