One other note is that the paper you mentioned applies far more filters to the other tools than methylKit/eDMR (Figure 2), which make the comparison between the tools a bit of apples to oranges.
https://academic.oup.com/bib/article-lookup/doi/10.1093/bib/bbv095

Other are limited to 0.9 quantile, which would dramatically change the results, along with some of the other filters.

